  "idea": "Jellyfin: self-host your own private media streaming server for free",
  "text": "The open-source Plex alternative with zero tracking, paywalls, or premium feature locks. Mainstream media servers increasingly harvest personal data, inject sponsored content, and restrict basic mobile playback behind paywalls. Relying on proprietary software leaves your private internal video library vulnerable to remote account lockouts. Jellyfin gives you a completely free, open-source streaming ecosystem with hardware acceleration and zero tracking. You enjoy private on-demand streaming across all devices.",
